{"id": "33005", "title": "历史的天空", "author": "徐贵祥", "category": "文学名著", "count": 116, "available": 12, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/33/33005.htm", "intro": "《历史的天空》是一幅别开声面的画卷。在若明若暗的历史云翳中，每个人都可以通过自己的方式去解读这个故事。可以说是粱某人由草莽少年成长为叱咤风云的高级将领，由梁大牙而梁必达的个人传奇；也可以说是一群生于乱世的平凡人卷在时代旋涡中一段身不由己的恩怨情仇。在徐贵祥的笔下，历史是那么熟悉而又陌生，凝重而又灵动，使人们觉得历史不仅恢复了体温，而且恢复了历史的丰富个性，对小说的阅读既成了对历史的一种回归，也成了对历史的一种发现。", "base": "files/article/html/33/33005", "chapters": [{"title": "第一部分", "volume": true}, {"title": "第一章", "file": "2103420.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二章", "file": "2103421.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第三章", "file": "2103422.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第四章", "file": "2103423.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第五章", "file": "2103424.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第六章", "file": "2103425.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第七章", "file": "2103426.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第八章", "file": "2103427.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第九章", "file": "2103428.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十章", "file": "2103429.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十一章", "file": "2103430.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十二章", "file": "2103431.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十三章", "file": "2103432.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十四章", "file": "2103433.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十五章", "file": "2103434.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十六章", "file": "2103435.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十七章", "file": "2103437.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十八章", "file": "2103436.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十九章", "file": "2103438.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十章", "file": "2103439.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二部分", "volume": true}, {"title": "第二十一章", "file": "2103440.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十二章", "file": "2103441.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十三章", "file": "2103442.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十四章", "file": "2103444.h